{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05346","headline":"塞外三首 三 · 郑愔","name":"塞外三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阳鸟南飞夜，阴山北地寒。\n汉家征戍客，年岁在楼兰。\n玉塞朔风起，金河秋月团。\n边声入鼓吹，霜气下旌竿。\n海外归书断，天涯旅鬓残。\n子卿犹奉使，常向节旄看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05346.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05346","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}